      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "マグマだんの　かがくぎじゅつを\nけっしゅうして　つくられた　スーツ。\nどんな　しょうげき　にも　たえられる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "마그마단이 과학기술을\n결집하여 만든 슈트다.\n어떠한 충격에도 견딜 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "集結了熔岩隊的\n科學技術製造的服裝。\n能承受任何衝擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une combinaison créée à partir des méthodes\nscientifiques de la Team Magma.\nElle résiste à tous les chocs.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Anzug, der unter Einsatz des gesamten\ntechnischen Wissens von Team Magma entstand.\nHält jeder Art von Erschütterung stand.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este traje es el resultado de las arduas\ninvestigaciones científicas del Equipo Magma.\nEs capaz de soportar cualquier impacto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tuta altamente tecnologica costruita dal\nTeam Magma, in grado di resistere a qualunque\nshock.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A suit made with the collective technological\nknow-how of Team Magma. It can withstand\nany impact.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
